BAB V

PENCEGAHAN DAN PENANGANAN

Pasal 9

1. Pemerintah Daerah wajib menyelenggarakan Pencegahan Kekerasan terhadap Perempuan secara cepat, terpadu dan terintegrasi.
2. Penyelenggaraan Pencegahan tindak Kekerasan terhadap Perempuan sebagaimana dimaksud ayat (1) dilakukan melalui bidang:
a. Pendidikan;
b. Sarana dan prasarana Publik;
c. Pemerintah dan tatakelola kelembagaand. Ekonomi dan ketenagakerjaan;
e. Kesejahteraan sosial;
f. Budaya;
g. Teknologi informatika;
h. Keagamaan; dan
i. Keluarga.

translated_text:
CHAPTER V

PREVENTION AND HANDLING

Article 9

1. The Regional Government is obliged to organize Prevention of Violence against Women quickly, in an integrated and integrated manner.
2. The organization of Prevention of acts of Violence against Women as referred to in paragraph (1) is carried out through the fields of:
a. Education;
b. Public facilities and infrastructure;
c. Government and institutional governance;
d. Economy and employment;
e. Social welfare;
f. Culture;
g. Information technology;
h. Religion; and
i. Family.

text:
Pasal 10

Penanganan terhadap perempuan korban kekerasan adalah dengan pemberian pelayanan secara terintegrasi dan terpadu meliputi:
a. cakupan Perempuan Korban Kekerasan yang mendapatkan penanganan pengaduan oleh petugas terlatih di dalam unit Pelayanan terpadu;
b. cakupan Perempuan Korban Kekerasan yang mendapatkan layalan kesehatan oleh tenaga kesehatan terlatih di puskesmas dan di rumah sakit;
c. cakupan layanan Rehabilitasi Sosia1 yang diberikan oleh petugas Rehabilitasi Sosial terlatih bagi Perempuan Korban Kekerasan di dalam unit Pelayanan terpadu;
d. cakupan layanan bimbingan rohani yang diberikan oleh petugas bimbingan rohani terlatih bagi Perempuan Korban Kekerasan di dalam unit Pelayanan terpadu;
e. cakupan penegakan hukum dari tingkat penyidikan sampai dengan putusan pengadilan atas kasus-kasus Kekerasan Terhadap Perempuan;
f. cakupan Perempuan Korban Kekerasan yang mendapatkan layanan Bantuan Hukum;
g. cakupan layanan Pemulangan bagi Perempuan Korban Kekerasan; dan
h. cakupan layanan Reintegrasi Sosial bagi Perempuan Korban Kekerasan.

translated_text:
Article 10

Handling of women victims of violence is by providing integrated and integrated services including:
a. coverage of Women Victims of Violence who receive complaint handling by trained officers in integrated Service units;
b. coverage of Women Victims of Violence who receive health services by trained health workers at community health centers and hospitals;
c. coverage of Social Rehabilitation services provided by trained Social Rehabilitation officers for Women Victims of Violence in integrated Service units;
d. coverage of spiritual guidance services provided by trained spiritual guidance officers for Women Victims of Violence in integrated Service units;
e. coverage of law enforcement from the investigation level to court decisions on cases of Violence Against Women;
f. coverage of Women Victims of Violence who receive Legal Aid services;
g. coverage of Repatriation services for Women Victims of Violence; and
h. coverage of Social Reintegration services for Women Victims of Violence.

