BAB X

PERANSERTAMASYARA^A*T

Pasal 18

1. Dalam menyelenggarakan Perlindungan terhadap Perempuan Korban Kekerasan, masyarakat dapat:
a. membentuk mitra Keluarga di tingkat kelurahan/Desa;
b. membentuk unit Perlindungan Perempuan di dalam organisasi kemasyarakatan;
c. melakukan sosialisasi hak Perempuan secara mandiri;
d. melakukan pertolongan pertama kepada Korban; dan
e. melaporkan kepada instansi yang berwenang apabila dilingkungannya terjadi Kekerasan terhadap Korbal.
2. Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dilakukan oleh perorangan, lembaga sosial kemasyarakatan, lembaga swadaya Masyarakat, lembaga pendidikan, lembaga keagamaan, swasta, dan media massa.

translated_text:
CHAPTER X

COMMUNITY PARTICIPATION

Article 18

1. In organizing Protection for Women Victims of Violence, the community may:
a. form Family partners at the sub-district/Village level;
b. form Women's Protection units within community organizations;
c. conduct socialization of Women's rights independently;
d. provide first aid to Victims; and
e. report to the competent authority if Violence against Victims occurs in their environment.
2. Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) is carried out by individuals, social community institutions, non-governmental organizations, educational institutions, religious institutions, the private sector, and mass media.
